WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:04,020
You stayed behind closed doors for more than half a year

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:06,620
Today I suddenly went to the polo club

3
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:09,020
And I happened to meet the prince

4
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:11,020
Do you want to be the Sentai Prince?

5
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:13,640
Just a coincidence

6
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,020
two days ago

7
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,620
His Majesty has surrendered to prison

8
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:19,820
The imperial concubine was confused and waited on her behalf.

9
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:20,820
never leaving

10
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:22,420
Although the Sixth Prince is young

11
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:24,020
But there is such a mother here

12
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,820
No one can predict what will happen in the future.

13
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:27,420
Although the prince is young and strong,

14
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:29,020
But there is no support from the mother clan

15
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:30,820
You are the future owner of Pingninghou Mansion

16
00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:32,420
what way to go

17
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:36,090
You have to choose

18
00:00:36,090 --> 00:00:37,910
What my father said

19
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:41,860
I should tell Shen Chao about you

20
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:43,860
With that guy who only knows how to drink and mess around all day long

21
00:00:43,860 --> 00:00:45,660
The bastard said this

22
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:49,700
It's okay to play the piano to a cow

23
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:50,700
You go back
